    {
      "path": "chainlesschain-ide-bridge/lib/chainlesschain-ide-bridge-0.4.198.jar!/META-INF/plugin.xml",
      "text": "<idea-plugin>\r\n  <idea-version since-build=\"242\" />\r\n  <id>com.chainlesschain.ide</id>\r\n  <name>ChainlessChain IDE Bridge</name>\r\n  <version>0.4.198</version>\r\n  <vendor url=\"https://github.com/chainlesschain/chainlesschain\">ChainlessChain</vendor>\r\n  <description><![CDATA[<b>ChainlessChain IDE Bridge</b> brings the ChainlessChain <code>cc</code>\n        agent CLI into your JetBrains IDE — a full AI coding agent in a side panel\n        that sees your editor, edits through native diffs you approve, and runs\n        your app, without leaving the IDE.\n        <br/><br/>\n        It runs a localhost MCP server exposing your active selection, diagnostics,\n        open editors and native diff review as tools the agent can call, and writes a\n        discovery lockfile so a <code>cc agent</code> you run in any terminal\n        auto-connects to this project's bridge.\n        <br/><br/>\n        <b>What you get</b>\n        <ul>\n          <li><b>Chat tool window with conversation tabs</b> — talk to the agent in\n              the right-dock \"ChainlessChain\" panel: streaming replies, tool-call\n              trace, and multiple conversations as tabs (each its own\n              <code>cc agent</code> process; switch instantly, close, reopen). Tabs\n              and their sessions resume across IDE restarts. New chat\n              (<code>Ctrl/Cmd+Alt+Shift+D</code>), reopen last closed\n              (<code>Ctrl/Cmd+Alt+Shift+R</code>).</li>\n          <li><b>Editor-aware out of the box</b> — your selection and open tabs ride\n              along with every prompt; after the agent edits a file, the IDE's fresh\n              errors/warnings flow back into the same run so it fixes what it broke.\n              (<code>CC_IDE_CONTEXT=0</code> to opt out.)</li>\n          <li><b>Native diff review</b> — file edits become a side-by-side IDE diff:\n              <em>Accept</em>, <em>Request changes…</em> (inline notes go back to the\n              agent), or <em>Reject</em> (never writes). Multi-file changes open as a\n              single <code>openMultiDiff</code> batch — accept all, pick files, or\n              reject.</li>\n          <li><b>Approval modes &amp; extended thinking</b> — slash commands in the\n              panel: <code>/auto</code> (accept edits), <code>/bypass</code>,\n              <code>/normal</code>; <code>/think</code> · <code>/ultrathink</code> ·\n              <code>/think-off</code> (Anthropic). Also <code>/new</code>\n              <code>/stop</code> <code>/cost</code> <code>/context</code>\n              <code>/plan</code> <code>/approve</code> <code>/reject</code>.</li>\n          <li><b>Interactive plan &amp; approval cards</b> — plans and tool-permission\n              prompts render as cards with Approve / Deny (Approve / Reject) buttons,\n              right in the chat.</li>\n          <li><b>Selection actions &amp; @-mentions</b> — right-click code →\n              <em>Explain</em> or <em>Refactor</em>; <code>Ctrl/Cmd+Alt+Shift+K</code>\n              inserts an <code>@file#L5-10</code> reference for the selection; type\n              <code>@</code> for a completion popup of\n              <code>@selection</code>/<code>@diagnostics</code> + project files +\n              class &amp; method symbols.</li>\n          <li><b>In-editor app preview</b> — <em>Start App Preview</em> finds your dev\n              script, runs the dev server, detects the URL and embeds it (JCEF, with\n              an external-browser fallback); a one-click Restart if the server dies.</li>\n          <li><b>Live context window</b> — a subtle line under the chat shows model\n              context usage after each turn.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <b>Requirements:</b> the ChainlessChain <code>cc</code> CLI on your PATH\n        (<code>npm i -g chainlesschain</code>) and a configured model\n        (Tools → \"ChainlessChain: Configure LLM\", or <code>cc config</code>).\n        Open-source: <a href=\"https://github.com/chainlesschain/chainlesschain\">github.com/chainlesschain/chainlesschain</a>.]]></description>\r\n  <!-- AUTO-GENERATED at build time from CHANGELOG.md by build.gradle.kts\n         (intellijPlatform.pluginConfiguration.changeNotes → patchPluginXml\n         overrides this element). Do NOT hand-edit — edit CHANGELOG.md instead.\n         The content below is only a fallback if the gradle render fails. -->\r\n  <change-notes><![CDATA[<b>[0.4.198] - Memory authority and diagnostics release candidate (2026-11-08)</b><br/><ul><li>Recommend CLI 0.166.145 and pair with VS Code/Open VSX 0.37.181 after verified Session Core 0.3.27 and CLI publication.</li><li>Include the read-only model-input diagnostics entry in the canonical public IDE capability contract and generated documentation.</li><li>Retain strict host matrices and upstream readback. Package publication does not grant native GUI, real-model or paid readiness.</li></ul><br/><b>[0.4.197] - goal transfer release candidate (2026-11-08)</b><br/><ul><li>Recommend CLI 0.166.144 and pair with the other IDE 0.37.180 after verified Session Core 0.3.27 and CLI publication.</li><li>Carry explicit goal transfer, signed rollback and the native canonical Graph host boundary through the matching CLI source.</li><li>Enable Windows Git long paths before CI checkout so immutable native acceptance artifacts do not prevent checks from starting.</li><li>Candidate only: exact-source release gates and public package readback remain required; no desktop installer or new business acceptance is claimed.</li></ul><br/><b>[0.4.196] - local compute and pending task creation (2026-11-06)</b><br/><ul><li>Recommend CLI 0.166.143; publish after verified Session Core 0.3.26 and CLI, pairing with the other IDE 0.37.179.</li><li>Add a distinct Local compute / OpenAI compatible option for LEXDATA, vLLM and SGLang, custom platform model IDs, optional platform keys, explicit HTTP consent and atomic CLI readback.</li><li>Keep relay protocol selection separate, never reuse an old endpoint key for a new keyless platform, and verify saved credentials only when required or explicitly supplied.</li><li>Add explicit task-creation request-file and v6 pending-draft controls for admitted scenario packages; matching desktop native consent and confirmation remain required.</li><li>Actual LEXDATA inference, real IDE GUI and business-effect assessment remain unverified; the supplied LEXDATA discovery connection was reset.</li></ul><br/><b>[0.4.195] - authorized goal events and retained history (2026-11-05)</b><br/><ul><li>Recommend CLI 0.166.142 and pair with Open VSX 0.37.178 after verified upstream publication.</li><li>Add explicit desktop event observation and retained-history recovery with native connection/checkpoint selection, bounded plain-text results, cancellation and host-bound next-page controls.</li><li>Use CLI exit zero plus protocol validation to confirm checkpoint commit; interruption retains an unknown checkpoint outcome.</li><li>Support the admitted project-delivery-assistant 0.2.0 scenario through existing evidence and pending-description controls. Native consent remains required.</li></ul><br/><b>[0.4.194] - complete source preview recovery pairing (2026-11-04)</b><br/><ul><li>Recommend CLI 0.166.141 and pair with Open VSX 0.37.177 after verified CLI publication.</li><li>Carry the shared runtime repair that preserves legitimate source spread expressions in file-read previews and keeps recovery instructions actionable.</li><li>Align the CLI and IDE entry boundaries in launcher-owned hermetic evaluations without changing ordinary interactive permissions or the IDE protocol.</li><li>Retain historical model results and finite diagnostic budgets. This release performs no additional paid model-task retests.</li></ul>]]></change-notes>\r\n  <depends>com.intellij.modules.platform</depends>\r\n  <!-- Localization: action text/description resolve from messages/CcBundle\n         (English base) + CcBundle_zh (Chinese) via action.<id>.text /\n         action.<id>.description keys. The IDE picks the locale (e.g. the Chinese\n         Language Pack sets zh). Runtime Java dialog strings localize in a\n         follow-up pass (a DynamicBundle over this same bundle). -->\r\n  <resource-bundle>messages.CcBundle</resource-bundle>\r\n  <extensions defaultExtensionNs=\"com.intellij\">\r\n    <postStartupActivity implementation=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.IdeBridgeStartup\" />\r\n    <applicationService serviceImplementation=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.CcSettings\" />\r\n    <!-- Settings → Tools → ChainlessChain IDE (cc path + context indicator);\n             VS Code chainlesschain.cli.path / chat.contextIndicator parity. -->\r\n    <applicationConfigurable parentId=\"tools\" id=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.settings\" displayName=\"ChainlessChain IDE\" instance=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.CcConfigurable\" />\r\n    <projectService serviceImplementation=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.IdeBridgeService\" />\r\n    <projectService serviceImplementation=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.PreviewService\" />\r\n    <toolWindow id=\"ChainlessChain\" anchor=\"right\" secondary=\"true\" icon=\"/icons/chainlesschain.png\" factoryClass=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.ChatToolWindowFactory\" />\r\n    <toolWindow id=\"ChainlessChain Preview\" anchor=\"bottom\" secondary=\"true\" icon=\"/icons/chainlesschain.png\" factoryClass=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.PreviewToolWindowFactory\" />\r\n    <!-- Live JCEF dashboard (status cards + tool-call stream); VS Code\n             chainlesschain.ide.openDashboard parity. -->\r\n    <toolWindow id=\"ChainlessChain Dashboard\" anchor=\"right\" secondary=\"true\" icon=\"/icons/chainlesschain.png\" factoryClass=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.DashboardToolWindowFactory\" />\r\n    <!-- Unified sessions workbench (gap #3): chat sessions + cross-IDE\n             index + background agents + remote-control hosts in one table. -->\r\n    <toolWindow id=\"ChainlessChain Sessions\" anchor=\"right\" secondary=\"true\" icon=\"/icons/chainlesschain.png\" factoryClass=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.SessionsWorkbenchToolWindowFactory\" />\r\n    <toolWindow id=\"ChainlessChain Automation\" anchor=\"right\" secondary=\"true\" icon=\"/icons/chainlesschain.png\" factoryClass=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.AutomationCenterToolWindowFactory\" />\r\n    <statusBarWidgetFactory id=\"chainlesschain.ide.statusBar\" implementation=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.BridgeStatusBarWidgetFactory\" />\r\n    <!-- Balloon notifications (one-shot cc-upgrade \"What's New\" nudge; VS\n             Code showInformationMessage parity). -->\r\n    <notificationGroup id=\"ChainlessChain\" displayType=\"BALLOON\" />\r\n    <intentionAction>\r\n      <className>com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.FixWithCcIntention</className>\r\n      <category>ChainlessChain</category>\r\n    </intentionAction>\r\n    <!-- jetbrains://idea/chainlesschain/open?prompt=… deep link (VS Code\n             registerUriHandler parity): focus the chat tool window + seed a prompt. -->\r\n    <jbProtocolCommand implementation=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.CcProtocolCommand\" />\r\n    <!-- Ghost-text inline completion: manual trigger plus governed,\n             default-off automatic mode; shares the `cc complete` backend. -->\r\n    <inline.completion.provider implementation=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.CcInlineCompletionProvider\" />\r\n  </extensions>\r\n  <actions>\r\n    <!-- text/description resolve from messages/CcBundle via\n             action.<id>.text / action.<id>.description (see <resource-bundle>). -->\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.ide.ShowStatus\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.ShowStatusAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.ide.ShowActivity\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.ShowActivityAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.ide.OpenDashboard\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.OpenDashboardAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.team.Monitor\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.TeamMonitorAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.session.PrStatus\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.PrStatusAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.bg.Agents\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.BackgroundAgentsAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.remote.Control\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.RemoteControlAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.sessions.Workbench\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.SessionsWorkbenchAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.automation.Center\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.AutomationCenterAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.usage.Show\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.ShowUsageAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.artifacts.Browse\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.ArtifactsAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.evolution.Workbench\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.EvolutionWorkbenchAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.evolution.Configure\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.ConfigureEvolutionDeploymentAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.skills.Retrieve\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.SkillRetrievalAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.policy.Viewer\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.PolicyViewerAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.context.Center\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.ContextCenterAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.session.ModelInputs\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.ModelInputDiagnosticsAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.plugins.Manage\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.PluginManagerAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.worktree.Tasks\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.WorktreeTasksAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.chrome.Connector\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.ChromeConnectorAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.workspace.ScanAutoExec\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.AutoExecScanAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <!-- Managed CLI runtime (gap #2 插件托管/内置 CLI; VS Code managed-cli twin):\n             used ONLY when no usable global cc is found — an explicit configured\n             cc path is never replaced. -->\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.managedCli.Install\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.InstallManagedCliAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.managedCli.Rollback\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.RollbackManagedCliAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.ide.DiagnoseBridge\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.DiagnoseBridgeAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.ide.ExportDiagnostics\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.ExportDiagnosticsAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.ide.RestartBridge\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.RestartBridgeAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.cli.whatsNew\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.ShowWhatsNewAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.ide.ConfigureLlm\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.ConfigureLlmAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.ide.ConfigureVisionModel\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.ConfigureVisionModelAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.chat.newConversation\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.NewConversationAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n      <!-- Ctrl+Alt+N is IDEA's Refactor→Inline and Ctrl+Shift+Esc is OS-reserved\n                 on Windows — use an unclaimed Ctrl+Alt+Shift chord instead (D = dialog);\n                 rebindable in Settings → Keymap. -->\r\n      <keyboard-shortcut keymap=\"$default\" first-keystroke=\"control alt shift D\" />\r\n      <keyboard-shortcut keymap=\"Mac OS X 10.5+\" first-keystroke=\"meta alt shift D\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.chat.reopenClosedConversation\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.ReopenClosedConversationAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n      <!-- Ctrl+Shift+T is IDEA's Navigate→Go to Test — use an unclaimed\n                 Ctrl+Alt+Shift chord (R = reopen); rebindable in Settings → Keymap. -->\r\n      <keyboard-shortcut keymap=\"$default\" first-keystroke=\"control alt shift R\" />\r\n      <keyboard-shortcut keymap=\"Mac OS X 10.5+\" first-keystroke=\"meta alt shift R\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <!-- Ghost-text: fire an explicit inline-completion request at the caret.\n             Alt+\\ matches the VS Code keybinding; rebindable in Settings → Keymap.\n             Automatic typing remains independently opt-in under plugin settings. -->\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.completion.trigger\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.TriggerCompletionAction\">\r\n      <keyboard-shortcut keymap=\"$default\" first-keystroke=\"alt BACK_SLASH\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.chat.explainSelection\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.ExplainSelectionAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"EditorPopupMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.chat.refactorSelection\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.RefactorSelectionAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"EditorPopupMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.chat.insertFileReference\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.InsertFileReferenceAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"EditorPopupMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n      <!-- Ctrl+Alt+K is IDEA's Git Commit and Push — use an unclaimed\n                 Ctrl+Alt+Shift chord (K kept for muscle memory); rebindable in\n                 Settings → Keymap. -->\r\n      <keyboard-shortcut keymap=\"$default\" first-keystroke=\"control alt shift K\" />\r\n      <keyboard-shortcut keymap=\"Mac OS X 10.5+\" first-keystroke=\"meta alt shift K\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.memory.init\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.GenerateProjectMemoryAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.memory.files\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.ShowMemoryFilesAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.preview.start\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.StartPreviewAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n    <action id=\"chainlesschain.preview.stop\" class=\"com.chainlesschain.ide.intellij.StopPreviewAction\">\r\n      <add-to-group group-id=\"ToolsMenu\" anchor=\"last\" />\r\n    </action>\r\n  </actions>\r\n</idea-plugin>\r\n"
    }
  ],
  "officialArtifactParity": "not rerun"
}
